      "id": "q-s1-1-3-0001",
      "title": "範例3：（ ）已知a + b = 4﹐a × b = 2﹐則下列",
      "question_text": "（ ）已知a + b = 4﹐a × b = 2﹐則下列選項何者錯誤﹖ (1)a^2^ + b^2^ = 12",
      "answer_text": "",
      "explanation_text": "(2)a^3^ + b^3^ = 40 (3)a^5^ + b^5^ = 480 (4)$\\frac{1}{a^{2}} + \\frac{1}{b^{2}} = 3$﹒\n+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n【解析】∵a + b = 4﹐a × b = 2﹐\\\n∴a^2^ + b^2^ = (a + b)^2^ − 2ab = 12﹐\\\na^3^ + b^3^ = (a + b)^3^ − 3ab(a + b) = 40﹐\\\na^5^ + b^5^ = (a^2^ + b^2^)(a^3^ + b^3^) − a^2^b^2^(a + b) = 464﹐\\\n$\\frac{1}{a^{2}} + \\frac{1}{b^{2}} = \\frac{a^{2} + b^{2}}{a^{2}b^{2}} = \\frac{12}{4} = 3$﹐\\\n故選(3)﹒\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n範例4\n若$a + \\frac{1}{a}$=3, 試求下列各值：(1)$a^{2} + \\frac{1}{a^{2}}$. (2)$a^{3} + \\frac{1}{a^{3}}$.\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】(1)$a^{2} + \\frac{1}{a^{2}} = (a + \\frac{1}{a})^{2} - 2 \\cdot a \\cdot \\frac{1}{a} = 3^{2} - 2$= 7.\\\n(2)$a^{3} + \\frac{1}{a^{3}} = (a + \\frac{1}{a})^{3} - 3 \\cdot a \\cdot \\frac{1}{a}(a + \\frac{1}{a}) = 3^{3} - 3 \\cdot 3$ = 18.\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n隨堂練習\n設$x = \\sqrt{5} - 2$﹐求下列各式的值﹕(1)$x + \\frac{1}{x}$﹒ (2)$x^{2} + \\frac{1}{x^{2}}$﹒ (3)$x^{3} + \\frac{1}{x^{3}}$﹒\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】(1)$x + \\frac{1}{x} = (\\sqrt{5} - 2) + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5} - 2} = (\\sqrt{5} - 2) + (\\sqrt{5} + 2) = 2\\sqrt{5}$﹒\\\n(2)$x^{2} + \\frac{1}{x^{2}} = (x + \\frac{1}{x})^{2} - 2 = (2\\sqrt{5})^{2} - 2 = 18$﹒\\\n(3)$x^{3} + \\frac{1}{x^{3}} = (x + \\frac{1}{x})(x^{2} - x \\cdot \\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{x^{2}}) = (2\\sqrt{5})(18 - 1) = 34\\sqrt{5}$﹒\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n範例5\n利用乘法公式﹐因式分解下列各式﹕(1)x^6^ − y^6^﹒(2)9x^4^ + 5x^2^ + 1﹒.\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n> 【解析】(1)x^6^ − y^6^ = (x^3^)^2^ − (y^3^)^2^ = (x^3^ + y^3^)(x^3^ − y^3^)\\\n> = (x + y)(x − y)(x^2^ − xy + y^2^)(x^2^ + xy + y^2^)﹒\\\n> (2)9x^4^ + 5x^2^ + 1 = \\[(3x^2^)^2^ + 6x^2^ + 1\\] − x^2^\\\n> = (3x^2^ + 1)^2^ − x^2^ = (3x^2^ − x + 1)(3x^2^ + x + 1)﹒\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n範例6\n利用乘法公式﹐因式分解下列各式﹕(1)x^3^ + 8﹒(2)x^4^ − 81﹒(3)a^4^ + a^2^ + 1﹒\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】(1)x^3^ + 8 = x^3^ + 2^3^ = (x + 2)(x^2^ − 2x + 4)﹒\\\n(2)x^4^ − 81 = (x^2^)^2^ − 9^2^ = (x^2^ − 9)(x^2^ + 9) = (x − 3)(x + 3)(x^2^ + 9)﹒\\\n(3)a^4^ + a^2^ + 1 = \\[(a^2^)^2^ + 2a^2^ + 1\\] − a^2^ = (a^2^ + 1)^2^ − a^2^ = (a^2^ − a + 1)(a^2^ + a + 1)﹒\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n[\\]{.underline}\n隨堂練習\n利用乘法公式﹐因式分解下列各式﹕(1)8a^3^ + 27b^3^﹒(2)x^4^ + 4x^2^y^2^ + 16y^4^﹒\\\n(3)4a^4^ + 7a^2^ + 4﹒\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】(1)8a^3^ + 27b^3^ = (2a)^3^ + (3b)^3^ = (2a + 3b)\\[(2a)^2^ − (2a)(3b) + (3b)^2^\\]\\\n= (2a + 3b)(4a^2^ − 6ab + 9b^2^)﹒\\\n(2)x^4^ + 4x^2^y^2^ + 16y^4^ = (x^2^ + 4y^2^)^2^ − (2xy)^2^ = (x^2^ + 2xy + 4y^2^)(x^2^ − 2xy + 4y^2^)﹒\\\n(3)4a^4^ + 7a^2^ + 4 = \\[(2a^2^)^2^ + 8a^2^ + 2^2^\\] − a^2^ = (2a^2^ + 2)^2^ − a^2^ = (2a^2^ − a + 2)(2a^2^ + a + 2)﹒\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n隨堂練習\n利用乘法公式將下列各式因式分解：(1)x^8^ + x^4^ + 1. (2)(x^2^－1)(y^2^－1)－4xy.\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】(1)原式= x^8^ + 2x^4^ + 1－x^4^ = (x^4^ + 1)^2^－(x^2^)^2^\n=(x^4^+ x^2^ + 1)(x^4^－x^2^ + 1)\n=(x^4^ + 2x^2^ + 1－x^2^)(x^4^－x^2^ + 1)\n=\\[(x^2^ + 1)－x^2^\\]( x^4^－x^2^ + 1)\n=( x^2^ + x + 1)( x^2^－x + 1)( x^4^－x^2^ + 1).\\\n(2)原式=x^2^y^2^－x^2^－y^2^ + 1－4xy = (xy－1)^2^－(x + y)^2^\\\n=(xy + x + y－1)(xy－x－y－1)\n+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+",
