      "id": "q-s1-1-3-0002",
      "title": "範例7：已知a + b = 4﹐a × b = 2﹐則下列選項何",
      "question_text": "已知a + b = 4﹐a × b = 2﹐則下列選項何者錯誤﹖ (1)a^2^ + b^2^ = 12 (2)a^3^ + b^3^ = 40",
      "answer_text": "",
      "explanation_text": "(3)a^5^ + b^5^ = 480 (4)$\\frac{1}{a^{2}} + \\frac{1}{b^{2}} = 3$﹒\n+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n【解析】 ∵a + b = 4﹐a × b = 2﹐\\\n∴a^2^ + b^2^ = (a + b)^2^ − 2ab = 12﹐a^3^ + b^3^ = (a + b)^3^ − 3ab(a + b) = 40﹐\\\na^5^ + b^5^ = (a^2^ + b^2^)(a^3^ + b^3^) − a^2^b^2^(a + b) = 464﹐$\\frac{1}{a^{2}} + \\frac{1}{b^{2}} = \\frac{a^{2} + b^{2}}{a^{2}b^{2}} = \\frac{12}{4} = 3$﹐\\\n故選(3)﹒\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n範例8\n設實數x﹐y滿足x + 2y = 3﹐x^3^ + 8y^3^ = 9﹐求x^2^ + 4y^2^ = \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_﹒\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】已知x^3^ + 8y^3^ = x^3^ + (2y)^3^ = (x + 2y)^3^ − 3 ⋅ x ⋅ 2y(x + 2y) ⇒ 9 = 3^3^ − 6xy ⋅ 3 ⇒ xy = 1﹐\\\n∴x^2^ + 4y^2^ = (x + 2y)^2^ − 2 ⋅ x ⋅ 2y = 3^2^ − 4 × 1 =\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n隨堂練習\n已知x為實數且滿足$x^{2} - 4x + 1 = 0$﹐試求：(1)$x + \\frac{1}{x}$的值﹒ (2)$x^{2} + \\frac{1}{x^{2}}$的值﹒\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】(1)$x^{2} - 4x + 1 = 0$同除以x（$x \\neq 0$）﹐$x - 4 + \\frac{1}{x} = 0$﹐得$x + \\frac{1}{x} = 4$﹒\\\n(2)$(x + \\frac{1}{x})^{2} = x^{2} + 2 \\cdot x \\cdot \\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{x^{2}} = x^{2} + 2 + \\frac{1}{x^{2}}$﹐$16 = x^{2} + 2 + \\frac{1}{x^{2}}$﹐得$x^{2} + \\frac{1}{x^{2}} = 14$﹒\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n範例9\n化簡下列各式：(1)$\\frac{x－4}{3x－7}$＋$\\frac{5x－10}{3x－7}$＝[ ]{.underline}。 (2)$\\frac{2}{3x＋15}$＋$\\frac{x}{x^{2}－25}$＝[ ]{.underline}。\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】(1)$\\frac{x－4}{3x－7}$＋$\\frac{5x－10}{3x－7}$＝$\\frac{6x－14}{3x－7}$＝2\\\n(2)$\\frac{2}{3x＋15}$＋$\\frac{x}{x^{2}－25}$＝$\\frac{2}{3（x＋5）}$＋$\\frac{x}{（x－5）（x＋5）}$\\\n＝$\\frac{2（x－5）＋3x}{3（x＋5）（x－ 5）}$＝$\\frac{5x－10}{3（x＋5）（x－5）}$\\\n＝$\\frac{5（x－2）}{3（x＋5）（x－5）}$\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n隨堂練習\n化簡下列各式：(1)$\\frac{x＋3}{x－3}$－$\\frac{x－3}{x＋3}$＝[ ]{.underline}。 (2)$\\frac{x^{3}－3x^{2}}{x＋3}$×$\\frac{x^{2}－9}{x^{2}－6x＋9}$＝[ ]{.underline}。\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】(1)$\\frac{x＋3}{x－3}$－$\\frac{x－3}{x＋3}$＝$\\frac{（x＋3）^{2}－（x－3）^{2}}{（x－3）（x＋3）}$＝$\\frac{12x}{（x－3）（x＋3）}$\\\n(2)$\\frac{x^{3}－3x^{2}}{x＋3}$×$\\frac{x^{2}－9}{x^{2}－6x＋9}$＝$\\frac{x^{2}（x－3）}{x＋3}$×$\\frac{（x－3）（x＋3）}{（x－3）^{2}}$＝x^2^\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n隨堂練習\n化簡$\\frac{1}{x－1}$－$\\frac{1}{x＋1}$－$\\frac{2}{x^{2}＋1}$－$\\frac{4}{x^{4}＋1}$＝[ ]{.underline}。\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】$\\frac{1}{x－1}$－$\\frac{1}{x＋1}$－$\\frac{2}{x^{2}＋1}$－$\\frac{4}{x^{4}＋1}$＝$\\frac{2}{x^{2}－1}$－$\\frac{2}{x^{2}＋1}$－$\\frac{4}{x^{4}＋1}$\\\n＝$\\frac{4}{x^{4}－1}$－$\\frac{4}{x^{4}＋1}$＝$\\frac{4（x^{4}＋1）－4（x^{4}－1）}{（x^{4}－1）（x^{4}＋1）}$\n+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+",
