      "title": "範例10：化簡下列各式：(1)$\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{3}",
      "question_text": "化簡下列各式：(1)$\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{3}} + \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{27}} - \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{48}} =$\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_﹒ (2)$\\sqrt{24} - \\sqrt{3}(\\sqrt{18} + \\sqrt{6}) =$ \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_﹒",
      "answer_text": "",
      "explanation_text": "(3)$\\frac{\\sqrt{5} - \\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{5} + \\sqrt{3}} =$\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_﹒ (4)$(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{3} + \\sqrt{6}})^{2} + (\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{\\sqrt{2} + 1})^{2} =$\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_﹒\n+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n【解析】(1)原式$= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} + \\frac{1}{3\\sqrt{3}} - \\frac{1}{4\\sqrt{3}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{9} - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{12} = \\sqrt{3}(\\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{9} - \\frac{1}{12}) = \\frac{13}{36}\\sqrt{3}$﹒\\\n(2)原式$= 2\\sqrt{6} - 3\\sqrt{6} - 3\\sqrt{2} = - \\sqrt{6} - 3\\sqrt{2}$﹒\\\n(3)原式$= \\frac{(\\sqrt{5} - \\sqrt{3})^{2}}{5 - 3} = \\frac{8 - 2\\sqrt{15}}{2} = 4 - \\sqrt{15}$﹒\\\n(4)原式$= \\frac{2}{3(1 + \\sqrt{2})^{2}} + \\frac{6}{(\\sqrt{2} + 1)^{2}} = \\frac{2 + 6 \\times 3}{3(1 + \\sqrt{2})^{2}} = \\frac{20}{3(3 + 2\\sqrt{2})} = \\frac{20(3 - 2\\sqrt{2})}{3(9 - 8)} = 20 - \\frac{40}{3}\\sqrt{2}$﹒\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n範例11\n設x, y$\\in$Q且$x\\sqrt{3 + 2\\sqrt{2}} - y\\sqrt{17 - 12\\sqrt{2}} = \\sqrt{18 - 8\\sqrt{2}}$﹐則(x, y) = \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_﹒\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】原式 ⇒ x($\\sqrt{2} + 1$) − y($\\sqrt{9} - \\sqrt{8}$) =$\\sqrt{16} - \\sqrt{2}$\\\n⇒ x($\\sqrt{2} + 1$) − y($3 - 2\\sqrt{2}$) =$4 - \\sqrt{2}$\\\n⇒ (x − 3y) + (x + 2y)$\\sqrt{2}$=$4 - \\sqrt{2}$\\\n⇒ $\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{r}\nx - 3y = 4 \\\\\nx + 2y = - 1\n\\end{array} \\right.\\$ ∴ $\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{r}\nx = 1 \\\\\ny = - 1\n\\end{array} \\right.\\$ ⇒ (x﹐y) = (1﹐− 1)\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n隨堂練習\n若x﹐y ∈ Q﹐且x + y$\\sqrt{16 + \\sqrt{252}}$= x$\\sqrt{8 - \\sqrt{28}}$+ 15﹐求x^2^ + y^2^之值﹒\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】∵ x + y$\\sqrt{16 + \\sqrt{252}}$= x$\\sqrt{8 - \\sqrt{28}}$+ 15 \\\n∴ x + y$\\sqrt{16 + 2\\sqrt{63}}$= x$\\sqrt{8 - 2\\sqrt{7}}$+ 15 \\\n⇒ x + (3 +$\\sqrt{7}$)y = ($\\sqrt{7}$− 1)x + 15 \\\n\\\n⇒ (x + 3y) + y$\\sqrt{7}$= ( − x + 15) + x$\\sqrt{7}$\\\n∵ x﹐y ∈ Q﹐$\\sqrt{7}$為無理數 \\\n∴ $\\left\\{ \\begin{matrix}\nx + 3y = - x + 15 \\\\\ny = x\n\\end{matrix} \\right.\\$ ⇒ $\\left\\{ \\begin{matrix}\nx = 3 \\\\\ny = 3\n\\end{matrix} \\right.\\$\\\n∴ x^2^ + y^2^ = 3^2^ + 3^2^ = 18\n+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+",
