      "answer_text": "",
      "explanation_text": "(3)$\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{7} - \\sqrt{5}} - \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{7} + \\sqrt{5}} =$\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_﹒ (4)$\\sqrt{\\frac{11}{7}} + \\sqrt{\\frac{7}{11}} + \\frac{\\sqrt{11} + \\sqrt{7}}{\\sqrt{11} - \\sqrt{7}} =$\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_﹒\n+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n【解析】(1)$\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{3}} + \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{27}} - \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{48}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{27}} - \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{48}}$\\\n$${= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} + \\frac{1}{3\\sqrt{3}} - \\frac{1}{4\\sqrt{3}}\n}{= \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{9} - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{12}\n}{= (\\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{9} - \\frac{1}{12})\\sqrt{3} = \\frac{13}{36}\\sqrt{3}\n}$$(2)$\\frac{\\sqrt{5} - \\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{5} + \\sqrt{3}} = \\frac{(\\sqrt{5} - \\sqrt{3})^{2}}{(\\sqrt{5} + \\sqrt{3})(\\sqrt{5} - \\sqrt{3})} = \\frac{5 - 2\\sqrt{15} + 3}{5 - 3} = \\frac{8 - 2\\sqrt{15}}{2} = 4 - \\sqrt{15}$\\\n(3)$\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{7} - \\sqrt{5}} - \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{7} + \\sqrt{5}} = \\frac{2(\\sqrt{7} + \\sqrt{5})}{(\\sqrt{7} - \\sqrt{5})(\\sqrt{7} + \\sqrt{5})} - \\frac{4(\\sqrt{7} - \\sqrt{5})}{(\\sqrt{7} + \\sqrt{5})(\\sqrt{7} - \\sqrt{5})}$\\\n$$= \\frac{2(\\sqrt{7} + \\sqrt{5})}{7 - 5} - \\frac{4(\\sqrt{7} - \\sqrt{5})}{7 - 5}\n= \\sqrt{7} + \\sqrt{5} - 2(\\sqrt{7} - \\sqrt{5})$$\\\n=$\\sqrt{7} + \\sqrt{5} - 2\\sqrt{7} + 2\\sqrt{5}$\\\n$= - \\sqrt{7} + 3\\sqrt{5}$ \\\n(4)$\\sqrt{\\frac{11}{7}} + \\sqrt{\\frac{7}{11}} + \\frac{\\sqrt{11} + \\sqrt{7}}{\\sqrt{11} - \\sqrt{7}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{11}}{\\sqrt{7}} + \\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{\\sqrt{11}} + \\frac{\\sqrt{11} + \\sqrt{7}}{\\sqrt{11} - \\sqrt{7}}$\\\n$= \\frac{\\sqrt{11} \\times \\sqrt{7}}{\\sqrt{7} \\times \\sqrt{7}} + \\frac{\\sqrt{7} \\times \\sqrt{11}}{\\sqrt{11} \\times \\sqrt{11}} + \\frac{(\\sqrt{11} + \\sqrt{7})(\\sqrt{11} + \\sqrt{7})}{(\\sqrt{11} - \\sqrt{7})(\\sqrt{11} + \\sqrt{7})}$\\\n$= \\frac{\\sqrt{77}}{7} + \\frac{\\sqrt{77}}{11} + \\frac{(\\sqrt{11} + \\sqrt{7})^{2}}{11 - 7} = \\frac{\\sqrt{77}}{7} + \\frac{\\sqrt{77}}{11} + \\frac{11 + 2\\sqrt{77} + 7}{4}$\\\n$= (\\frac{1}{7} + \\frac{1}{11} + \\frac{1}{2})\\sqrt{77} + \\frac{18}{4} = \\frac{113}{154}\\sqrt{77} + \\frac{9}{2}$\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+",
