      "title": "範例12：設$a = \\sqrt{7 + \\sqrt{47}}$﹐",
      "question_text": "設$a = \\sqrt{7 + \\sqrt{47}}$﹐則a在哪兩個連續整數之間﹖",
      "answer_text": "",
      "explanation_text": "(1)0與1 (2)1與2 (3)2與3 (4)3與4 (5)4與5﹒\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n【解析】$6 < \\sqrt{47} < 7 \\Rightarrow 3 < \\sqrt{13} < \\sqrt{7 + \\sqrt{47}} < \\sqrt{14} < 4$﹐所以a在3與4之間﹒\n-----------------------------------------------------\n隨堂練習\n試問$\\sqrt{73 - \\sqrt{37}}$介在哪兩個連續整數之間？\n-----------------------------------------------------\n【解析】因為6^2^＜37＜7^2^, 所以6＜$\\sqrt{37}$＜7,\\\n則73－7＜73$- \\sqrt{37}$＜73－6，即66＜73$- \\sqrt{37}$＜67\\\n因此$\\sqrt{66} < \\sqrt{73 - \\sqrt{37}} < \\sqrt{67}$\\\n又8＜$\\sqrt{66}$且$\\sqrt{67}$＜9，所以8＜$73 - \\sqrt{37}$＜9\\\n故$73 - \\sqrt{37}$介在8與9之間.\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n範例13\n化簡下列根式：(1)$\\sqrt{4 - 2\\sqrt{3}}$﹒ (2)$\\sqrt{19 + 6\\sqrt{2}}$﹒\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【課本題】\n【解析】(1)$\\sqrt{4 - 2\\sqrt{3}} = \\sqrt{(\\sqrt{3})^{2} - 2\\sqrt{3} + 1} = \\sqrt{(\\sqrt{3} - 1)^{2}} = \\sqrt{3} - 1$（注意：$\\sqrt{3} - 1 > 0$）﹒(2)$\\sqrt{19 + 6\\sqrt{2}} = \\sqrt{19 + 2\\sqrt{9}\\sqrt{2}} = \\sqrt{19 + 2\\sqrt{18}}$\\\n$= \\sqrt{(\\sqrt{18})^{2} + 2\\sqrt{18} + 1} = \\sqrt{(\\sqrt{18} + 1)^{2}} = \\sqrt{18} + 1 = 3\\sqrt{2} + 1$﹒\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n隨堂練習\n試化簡下列各式：(1)$\\sqrt{17 + 12\\sqrt{2}}$. (2)$\\sqrt{5 - \\sqrt{24}}$.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】(1)$\\sqrt{17 + 12\\sqrt{2}} = \\sqrt{17 + 2\\sqrt{72}} = \\sqrt{(\\sqrt{9} + \\sqrt{8})^{2}} = \\sqrt{9} + \\sqrt{8} = 3 + 2\\sqrt{2}$.\\\n(2)$\\sqrt{5 - \\sqrt{24}} = \\sqrt{5 - 2\\sqrt{6}} = \\sqrt{(\\sqrt{3} - \\sqrt{2})^{2}} = \\sqrt{3} - \\sqrt{2}$.\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n範例14\n設$\\sqrt{39 - \\sqrt{432}}$的整數部分為a﹐小數部分為b﹐則$\\frac{11}{a + b} + \\frac{11}{a - b + 4}$之值為\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_﹒\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】$\\sqrt{39 - \\sqrt{432}} = \\sqrt{39 - 2\\sqrt{108}} = \\sqrt{36} - \\sqrt{3} = 6 - \\sqrt{3} = 4 + (2 - \\sqrt{3})$﹐\\\n∴a = 4﹐$b = 2 - \\sqrt{3}$﹒\\\n$\\frac{11}{a + b} + \\frac{11}{a - b + 4} = \\frac{11}{6 - \\sqrt{3}} + \\frac{11}{6 + \\sqrt{3}} = \\frac{11\\lbrack(6 + \\sqrt{3}) + (6 - \\sqrt{3})\\rbrack}{(6 - \\sqrt{3})(6 + \\sqrt{3})} = \\frac{11 \\times 12}{33} = 4$﹒\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n隨堂練習\n設$\\sqrt{21 + \\sqrt{80}}$的整數部分為$a$﹐小數部分為$b$﹐則$a + b - \\frac{4}{b} =$\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】$\\sqrt{21 + \\sqrt{80}} = \\sqrt{21 + 2\\sqrt{20}} = \\sqrt{20} + 1 = 5.\\cdots$\\\n∴$a = 5$﹐$b = \\sqrt{20} - 4$\\\n$a + b - \\frac{4}{b} = 5 + \\sqrt{20} - 4 - \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{20} - 4} = 5 + 2\\sqrt{5} - 4 - (2\\sqrt{5} + 4) = - 3$﹒\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n範例15\n$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - \\sqrt{12}}}$的純小數部分為$t$﹐則$\\frac{1}{t} - \\frac{1}{t + 1} =$\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_﹒\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - \\sqrt{12}}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - 2\\sqrt{3}}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3} - 1} = \\frac{\\sqrt{3} + 1}{2}$\\\n$\\frac{\\sqrt{3} + 1}{2} = 1.\\cdots$﹐整數$= 1$﹐$t = \\frac{\\sqrt{3} - 1}{2}$\\\n$\\frac{1}{t} - \\frac{1}{t + 1} = \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3} - 1} - \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3} + 1} = (\\sqrt{3} + 1) - (\\sqrt{3} - 1) = 2$﹒\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n隨堂練習\n設$\\sqrt{28}$的小數部分為k﹐將$\\sqrt{3 - k}$化為$\\sqrt{a} - b$的形式﹐若a﹐b為整數﹐則a + b = \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_﹒\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】$k = \\sqrt{28} - 5 = - 5 + 2\\sqrt{7} \\Rightarrow \\sqrt{3 - k} = \\sqrt{8 - 2\\sqrt{7}} = \\sqrt{7} - 1$﹐\\\n∴a = 7﹐b = 1﹐a + b = 8﹒\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n範例16\n設x$\\in$N﹐若$\\sqrt{3}$介於$\\frac{x + 5}{x}$與$\\frac{x + 6}{x + 1}$之間﹐則x之值為\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_﹒\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】∵ $\\frac{x + 5}{x} = 1 + \\frac{5}{x}$﹐$\\frac{x + 6}{x + 1} = 1 + \\frac{5}{x + 1}$且x$\\in$N\\\n∴ $1 + \\frac{5}{x + 1} < \\sqrt{3} < 1 + \\frac{5}{x}$ ⇒ $\\frac{5}{x + 1} < \\sqrt{3} - 1 < \\frac{5}{x}$\\\n又$\\sqrt{3} - 1$≒1.732 − 1 = 0.732\\\n⇒ $\\frac{5}{x + 1}$\\< 0.732 \\<$\\frac{5}{x}$ ∴ x = 6\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n範例17\n比較$a = \\sqrt{6} + \\sqrt{3},\\mspace{6mu}\\mspace{6mu} b = \\sqrt{7} + \\sqrt{2},\\mspace{6mu}\\mspace{6mu} c = \\sqrt{5} + \\sqrt{4}$之大小順序：\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_﹒\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】$a^{2} = 9 + 2\\sqrt{18}$﹐$b^{2} = 9 + 2\\sqrt{14}$﹐$c^{2} = 9 + 2\\sqrt{20}$﹐\\\n∵$\\sqrt{14} < \\sqrt{18} < \\sqrt{20}$﹐∴b^2^ \\< a^2^ \\< c^2^﹐\\\n即b \\< a \\< c﹒\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n隨堂練習\n試比較a=$\\sqrt{5} + \\sqrt{10}$, b=$\\sqrt{6} +$`<!-- -->`{=html}3, c = $\\sqrt{7} + 2\\sqrt{2}$之大小關係.\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】a^2^=$(\\sqrt{5} + \\sqrt{10})^{2} = 15 + 2\\sqrt{50}$\\\n$${b^{2} = (\\sqrt{6} + 3)^{2} = 15 + 2\\sqrt{54}\n}{c^{2} = (\\sqrt{7} + 2\\sqrt{2})^{2} = 15 + 2\\sqrt{56}\n}$$因為$\\sqrt{56} > \\sqrt{54} > \\sqrt{50}$\\\n所以c^2^＞b^2^＞a^2^, 故c＞b＞a.\n----------------------------------------\n範例18\n寫出$\\sqrt{2}$用小數表示的前三位小數﹒\n----------------------------------------\n【解析】1.414\\\n我們用十等分法逐步逼近如下：\\\n(1)首先﹐$1 < 2 < 4$﹐故$1 = \\sqrt{1} < \\sqrt{2} < \\sqrt{4} = 2$﹐即$\\sqrt{2} = 1.\\cdots$﹒\\\n(2)將1～2之間十等分﹐分點為$1.1,\\mspace{6mu}\\mspace{6mu} 1.2,\\mspace{6mu}\\mspace{6mu}\\cdots,\\mspace{6mu}\\mspace{6mu} 1.9$﹐分別計算這些數的平方﹐\\\n得$(1.4)^{2} = 1.96 < 2 < 2.25 = (1.5)^{2}$﹐故$1.4 < \\sqrt{2} < 1.5$﹐即$\\sqrt{2} = 1.4\\cdots$﹒\\\n(3)次將1.4～1.5之間十等分﹐又求得$(1.41)^{2} = 1.9881 < 2 < 2.0164 = (1.42)^{2}$﹐\\\n故$1.41 < \\sqrt{2} < 1.42$﹐即$\\sqrt{2} = 1.41\\cdots$﹒\\\n(4)再將1.41～1.42之間十等分﹐求得$(1.414)^{2} = 1.999396 < 2 < 2.002225 = (1.415)^{2}$﹒\\\n故$1.414 < \\sqrt{2} < 1.415$﹐即$\\sqrt{2} = 1.414\\cdots$﹒（以上計算可利用電算器）\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n隨堂練習\n若a為正實數且a的小數部分為b﹐a^2^ + b^2^ = 40﹐則a之值為\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_﹒\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】∵ 0 ≤ b \\< 1 ∴ 0 ≤ b^2^ \\< 1﹐又a^2^ + b^2^ = 40 ∴ b^2^ = 40 − a^2^\\\n⇒ 0 ≤ 40 − a^2^ \\< 1 ⇒ 39 ≤ a^2^ \\< 40 ∴ a的整數部分為6\\\n令a = 6 + b ⇒ (6 + b)^2^ + b^2^ = 40 ⇒ b^2^ + 6b − 2 = 0\\\n∴ b = − 3$\\pm \\sqrt{11}$（負不合） ⇒ a = 6 + ( − 3 +$\\sqrt{11}$) = 3 +$\\sqrt{11}$\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n隨堂練習\n設正實數a的純小數部分為b﹐已知a + b^2^ = n﹐n ∈ Z﹐求b之值﹒\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】設a = m + b﹐m ∈ Z﹐m ≥ 0﹐0 \\< b \\< 1\\\n∵ a + b^2^ = n﹐n ∈ Z ∴ m + b + b^2^ = n ⇒ b + b^2^ = n − m ∈ Z\\\n∵ 0 \\< b \\< 1 ∴ 0 \\< b^2^ \\< 1 ∴ 0 \\< b + b^2^ \\< 2\\\n∵ b + b^2^ ∈ Z ∴ b + b^2^ = 1 ⇒ b^2^ + b − 1 = 0 ∴ b =$\\frac{- 1 \\pm \\sqrt{5}}{2}$\\\n∵ 0 \\< b \\< 1 ∴ b =$\\frac{- 1 + \\sqrt{5}}{2}$\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n主題2：算幾不等式\n設a，b ≥ 0，則$\\frac{a＋b}{2}$≥$\\sqrt{ab}$恆成立，等號在a＝b時成立。\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+",
