      "question_text": "(1)設a﹐b是正實數﹐試證：$\\frac{a + b}{2} \\geq \\sqrt{ab} \\geq \\frac{2ab}{a + b}$﹒",
      "answer_text": "",
      "explanation_text": "(2)設a，b ≥ 0且a＋2b＝8，則ab之最大值為[ ]{.underline}，此時a＝[ ]{.underline}，b＝[ ]{.underline}。\n(3)設a，b＞0且ab＝25，則$\\frac{4}{a}$＋$\\frac{9}{b}$的最小值為[ ]{.underline}，此時a＝[ ]{.underline}，b＝[ ]{.underline}。\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n【解析】(1)$(\\frac{a + b}{2})^{2} - (\\sqrt{ab})^{2} = \\frac{a^{2} + 2ab + b^{2}}{4} - ab = \\frac{a^{2} - 2ab + b^{2}}{4} = \\frac{(a - b)^{2}}{4} \\geq 0$\\\n∴$\\frac{a + b}{2} \\geq \\sqrt{ab}$﹐又$\\frac{\\frac{1}{a} + \\frac{1}{b}}{2} \\geq \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{a} \\cdot \\frac{1}{b}}$即$\\frac{a + b}{2ab} \\geq \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{ab}}$﹐故$\\sqrt{ab} \\geq \\frac{2ab}{a + b}$\\\n※等號成立時a＝b\\\n(2)$\\frac{a＋2b}{2}$≥$\\sqrt{a \\times 2b}$ ⇨4 ≥ $\\sqrt{2ab}$\\\n∴16 ≥ 2ab ⇨ ab ≤ 8，當a＝2b＝4時，ab有最大值8\\\n此時a＝4，b＝2\\\n(3)$\\frac{\\frac{4}{a}＋\\frac{9}{b}}{2}$≥$\\sqrt{\\frac{4}{a} \\times \\frac{9}{b}}$＝$\\sqrt{\\frac{36}{25}}$＝$\\frac{6}{5}$\\\n∴$\\frac{4}{a}$＋$\\frac{9}{b}$≥$\\frac{12}{5}$，當$\\frac{4}{a}$＝$\\frac{9}{b}$＝$\\frac{6}{5}$時，$\\frac{4}{a}$＋$\\frac{9}{b}$有最小值$\\frac{12}{5}$\\\n此時a＝$\\frac{10}{3}$，b＝$\\frac{15}{2}$\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n隨堂練習\n設a，b ≥ 0 且2a＋3b＝10，則ab 之最大值為[ ]{.underline}，此時a＝[ ]{.underline}，b＝[ ]{.underline}。\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】∴25 ≥ 6ab，即ab ≤$\\frac{25}{6}$，當2a＝3b＝5時，ab有最大值$\\frac{25}{6}$\\\n此時a＝$\\frac{5}{2}$，b＝$\\frac{5}{3}$\n[\\]{.underline}\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n隨堂練習\n設a，b＞0且ab＝9，則$\\frac{1}{a}$＋$\\frac{4}{b}$的最小值為[ ]{.underline}，此時a＝[ ]{.underline}，b＝[ ]{.underline}。\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】$\\frac{\\frac{1}{a}＋\\frac{4}{b}}{2}$≥$\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{a} \\times \\frac{4}{b}}$＝$\\sqrt{\\frac{4}{9}}$＝$\\frac{2}{3}$\\\n∴$\\frac{1}{a}$＋$\\frac{4}{b}$≥$\\frac{4}{3}$，當$\\frac{1}{a}$＝$\\frac{4}{b}$＝$\\frac{2}{3}$時，$\\frac{1}{a}$＋$\\frac{4}{b}$有最小值$\\frac{4}{3}$\\\n此時a＝$\\frac{2}{3}$，b＝6\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+",
