      "question_text": "$a$,$b$皆為正實數，(1)若$2a + 3b = 6$﹐求$ab$之最大值$=$\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_﹒",
      "answer_text": "",
      "explanation_text": "(2)若$ab = 6$﹐求$3a + 2b$之最小值$=$\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_﹒\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n【解析】(1)$\\frac{2a + 3b}{2} \\geq \\sqrt{(2a)(3b)}$ $\\Rightarrow$ $\\frac{6}{2} \\geq \\sqrt{6ab}$ $\\Rightarrow$ $9 \\geq 6ab$ $\\Rightarrow$ $ab \\leq \\frac{9}{6} = \\frac{3}{2}$\\\n故$ab$的最大值為$\\frac{3}{2}$\\\n(2)$\\frac{3a + 2b}{2} \\geq \\sqrt{(3a)(2b)}$ $\\Rightarrow$ ![](.\\program-db\\imports\\packs\\s1-1-3\\assets/media/image2.wmf)$\\sqrt{6ab} = \\sqrt{6 \\times 6} = 6$\\\n$\\Rightarrow$ $3a + 2b \\geq 12$ ∴$3a + 2b$的最小值為12\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n隨堂練習\n設a \\> 0﹐b \\> 0且a + 2b = 8，則(1) ab之最大值為\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_﹒(2)此時(a﹐b) = \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_﹒\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】由算幾不等式知：$\\frac{a + 2b}{2} \\geq \\sqrt{a \\times 2b}$ ∴ $\\frac{8}{2} \\geq \\sqrt{2ab}$\\\n⇒ 16$\\geq$`<!-- -->`{=html}2ab ∴ ab$\\leq$`<!-- -->`{=html}8﹐即ab之最大值為8\\\n此時a = 2b = 4 ∴ a = 4﹐b = 2 ⇒ (a﹐b) = (4﹐2)\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n隨堂練習\n設$a,\\mspace{6mu}\\mspace{6mu} b$都是正數﹒\\\n(1)已知$a + b = 50$﹐求ab的最大值﹐又此時$a,\\mspace{6mu}\\mspace{6mu} b$之值各為何？\\\n(2)已知$a + 2b = 12$﹐求ab的最大值﹐又此時$a,\\mspace{6mu}\\mspace{6mu} b$之值各為何？\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n【解析】(1)利用$\\frac{a + b}{2} \\geq \\sqrt{ab}$得$\\frac{50}{2} \\geq \\sqrt{ab}$﹐即$\\sqrt{ab} \\leq 25$﹐\\\n因此ab ≤ 625﹐且當a = b = 25時﹐有最大值625﹒\\\n(2)a \\> 0﹐2b \\> 0時﹐$\\frac{a + 2b}{2} \\geq \\sqrt{a(2b)}$﹐即$\\frac{12}{2} \\geq \\sqrt{2ab}$﹐得2ab ≤ 36﹐\\\n且當a = 2b = 6時﹐ab有最大值18﹐此時a = 6﹐b = 3﹒\n+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------+",
